{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">惠州218公路，近年翻新成一條適合自駕遊的旅遊公路，沿途設16個驛站，帶你逛遍山林美景，體會自然和人文風光，是灣區自駕遊的新選擇。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主持：黎慧怡</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.7.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026qtE1YnfHB61790412456.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.7.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VFSGX12xe71790412497.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.2.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">「港車北上」帶動灣區自駕遊，近來路線亦多了，我們去粵東城市惠州，探索下惠州市政府前年斥資建成的218自駕遊公路。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263cthiK9xrW1790412525.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次請來在惠州工作的香港青年Jeff，做我們的柴可夫「司機」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.11.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264re28bkb4U1790412633.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.11.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">218公路全長218公里，在地圖上看是阿拉伯數字「8」字型，沿途設16個驛站，即休息站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"1.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MQYksTeBJs1790412669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由高鐵惠州北站開約1小時，這就是其中一個驛站，長灘藝術村。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.4.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20268MBIfqhNwz1790412698.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.4.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這條古村始建於明朝，青磚灰瓦。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026eP6360cmEU1790412728.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.5.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.8.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026xGHH3A7SC21790412764.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.8.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">脊獸彩繪，仿如置身600年前。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026zHl0DdvLxp1790412800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄰近村落仍保留著嶺南傳統的特色民居鑊耳屋，牆頂突出的部分就是「鑊耳」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在古代鑊耳越大，代表屋主官位越高，Jeff你是否猜到這間屋屋主官位是哪級？這條村南宋時期出過一個正二品大官，名為廖金鳳，這間屋就是由其後人所興建。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026TZfwQGWhoh1790412847.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">逛累了，想歇息，村落一帶有不少民居改建成的溫泉民宿，由600至3,000元不等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026F6ag9L9NdE1790412896.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不知不覺已到中午。其實驛站與驛站之間很近，大概10多20分鐘就有一個站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.16.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026zTvnFeT0EN1790413779.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.16.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">來到公路的中心交匯處，究竟是甚麼吸引這班鐵騎士？</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.12.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263iwgINGU101790412997.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.12.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">原來是這棵千年古榕樹。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">廣西旅客顧先生說：「開摩托車特別舒服，轉S彎好舒服，感覺當然爽。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.6.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261P64mzoCma1790413022.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.6.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">騎行的快樂，不止是遊山，還可以「環水」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.13.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026PiyP9BCuaN1790413356.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.13.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">我要去追我的「鹹蛋黃」，你們就留下欣賞美景吧。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"6.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026RqX0uyBHgt1790413416.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">太陽下山啦，我們才行完218公路的三分一。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0.15.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026YGYT50ha3s1790413617.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0.15.JPG\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">惠州港青Jeff說：「整個自駕遊體驗感覺非常好，有時候車之間相對較近，所以要注意安全，我肯定會再來。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">惠州218公路沿路的16個驛站，是以北宋詩人蘇東坡的「人生賞心16樂事」為主題，蘇東坡在惠州生活了近三年，留下詩句《食荔枝二首》，就提及「日啖荔枝三百顆，不辭長作嶺南人。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這條自駕遊公路2024年起投入營運，由惠州市政府投入數億元打造，連接博羅縣和龍門縣等多個鄉鎮，串聯羅浮山和南崑山，其中羅浮山是國家5A級景區，既有白蓮湖、東江縱隊紀念館等，亦開發了叢林飛躍、玻璃漂流等遊玩項目。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而16個驛站，各個驛站都有特色景點和美食，包括地道農家菜竹筒飯、客家山水豆腐、胡鬚雞、東坡梅菜扣肉、麻陂肉丸等。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當地旅遊部門推薦兩天一夜和三天兩夜自駕遊，特色民宿酒店選擇多元化，不少有溫泉或泳池。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T01:18:27.031286+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":939,"images":17,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}